WEBVTT

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:33.350
The Yokohama ramen is ready.

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:33.940
Okay.

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:36.870
One shaved ice with melon syrup
and one with sweet milk.

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.410
I'll have that ready
in just a moment.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:41.910
Man, it's busy today.
Squid Girl, the shaved ice-

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.960
Hey! You're shaving your tentacles!

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:51.380
<b>Aren't you a squiddle
under the weather?</b>

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:54.260
Sheesh, if there's any gossip
about health code violations,

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.090
our business will be ruined.

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:57.270
Be careful.

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:02.630
Is your tentacle okay?

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:03.990
Huh?

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:11.560
Thanks for the food.

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:15.760
You're done? You haven't
even eaten anything.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.840
Are you not feeling well?

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:19.930
You're so lifeless, Squid Girlie.

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:21.950
I'm just a little tired.

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.560
I'm going to bed now.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:28.670
You're not worried about
something, right?

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:31.660
It's kind of creepy when
she's not all energetic.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:34.500
Maybe it's summer fatigue.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.130
Oh, I see.

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.810
Since she's spent so much time up here,
living the good life,

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:42.080
she got the same modern
affliction as humans.

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.100
Me? Modern afflictions?

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.090
No squidding way!

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:50.060
I, who've spent many
years in the ocean,

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.480
would not... succumb...

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:00.070
What cures are there
for summer fatigue?

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.790
Let's see...

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.240
Turning off the AC and
switching to a normal fan.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:07.160
Taking a leisurely bath
in lukewarm water.

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:09.840
Or taking the plunge and
taking a cold bath.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:11.830
Light exercise.

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:14.420
Eating spicy food.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.610
Squii...

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:20.690
You're completely worn out.

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:23.720
It's not human summer fatigue!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:27.480
This squid can't be cured
by stuff like that!

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:30.790
Your words and your expression
are polar opposites.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.890
103.1 degrees.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.270
That's quite high.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:41.700
You should stay in bed today.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:45.350
I was planning on doing so anyway.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:49.210
By the way, if this isn't summer
fatigue, what is it?

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:50.330
A summer cold?

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:54.960
Squid... Squidininmulgobong
disease, I think...

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.680
Say what?

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:59.190
Man, I've never heard that before.

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:00.960
Is that a special Squid Girl disease?

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:05.360
Eiko, how's the store doing?

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.720
Don't worry.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:11.140
Cindy and Sanae are
filling in for us.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.030
Those two?

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:17.010
Listen, only you know
about your body.

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.960
Let me know if there is something

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.300
that will make you feel
even a little better.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:26.280
What are the symptoms of
squdinin-something disease?

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:28.780
Death...

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:29.950
Death?!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:33.990
Death..ly cravings for shrimp
is what this disease causes.

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:36.180
How's that different from normal?

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.720
The degree to which you
want to eat shrimp

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.680
can't even be compared
to normal times.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.320
So you'll be cured
if you eat shrimp?

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:46.740
No, if you eat shrimp when
you have this disease

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.820
things get worse.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.690
Get worse? Will the
fever go higher?

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.980
No, then you want to eat
shrimp even more.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:58.030
This disease gets you
so stressed out

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.470
because you can't eat shrimp
while you're tortured

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:03.500
by the desire for shrimp which
knows no squidly bounds!

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.060
That's really annoying!

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:07.950
So basically, you'll be fine if

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.120
you resist eating shrimp until
you're better, right?

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:14.000
Yeah, I guess so.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:14.600
Ugh!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:15.610
What's wrong?!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.570
I wanna eat shrimp.

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:22.670
I want shrimp, I want shrimp,
I want shrimp!

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.650
A fit?

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.410
I'll die if I don't eat some!

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.930
So you can die!

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:29.660
I want to at least eat
something shrimpy!

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:31.580
Something shrimpy?

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:32.700
I know!

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.070
Hey, I brought it, Squid Girl.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.480
Shrimp flowers.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.610
That's totally not shrimp!

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.780
Shrimp taro won't cut it either?

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.740
Shrimp! Shrimp!

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:48.780
Shrimp

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.200
Are you making fun of me?!

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:53.390
Shrimp, AB -> Ey B -> Ebi = Shrimp

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.410
That does nothing at all!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.560
Shrimp! Shrimp! Shrimp!

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:56.950
I give up.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:58.230
Shrimp! Shrimp! Shrimp!

00:05:56.950 --> 00:05:58.930
Man, what should I do...

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:05.370
Oh, no. The disease made
her lose control.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.260
At this rate...

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.130
Eiko...

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:10.590
Eiko!

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:22.130
I'd rather die than endure
this any longer.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.480
I want to eat shrimp...

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.780
But, Squid Girl...

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:29.590
It's my last request in this life.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:33.630
I can't do it, it's for
your own... good...

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.540
Shrimp. Shrimp.

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.140
This is weird.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:40.750
There are shrimp here,
but I can't grab them.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:43.460
I don't know if this is
stupid or adorable.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.170
Hey, Squid Girl.

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:48.430
Do you want to get better?

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.510
I want to get better
and eat shrimp.

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.350
Well, no pain, no gain.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:58.340
I need a favor.

00:06:58.340 --> 00:06:59.660
Can you come over right away?

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:01.250
Please.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:06.780
Fight fire... with fire!

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:10.490
I know you've already come over here,
but you can still cancel.

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.240
Don't make me laugh.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:16.790
Do you think I'll sit idle
while Squiddie suffers?

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:21.000
I'll gladly forfeit my life
for the one I love!

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:25.210
Sanae, you're actually
really cool right now.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.920
Who is it?

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.150
SHRIMP!

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.110
Did she calm down?

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:59.070
I'm home.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.050
Heya.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:01.890
How's Squid Girl?

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:04.040
I'm completely healed.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.800
I'm so glad!

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.310
But now...

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:10.020
Sanae won't return from
her personal paradise.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:14.930
I can finally eat shrimp
without any remorse.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:17.680
Let's have fried shrimp today.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:23.380
What the hell, you're
not cured yet.

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.750
It's fine, go back and rest in bed.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.460
I'm fine!

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:29.690
Yeah right!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.930
I'm completely squidly fine now!

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:33.200
So get me some shrimp...

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.490
Leave it to me!

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:40.540
S-stop it!

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:47.150
It's done.

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:47.920
It's perfect!

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.110
Yeah, I think it turned
out quite well.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:51.170
Yep!

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:56.010
Hah, it looks like that's the
limit for kids like you.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:56.930
What's that supposed to mean?

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.180
That's not even anywhere
comparable to my castle.

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:03.930
Behold the castle I have built!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.560
She built something weird.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.850
The kids never take me seriously,

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:12.400
so I have to strike preemptively sometimes!

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.850
What's that creepy thing?

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.540
It's not a castle, it's poop!

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:18.110
Right?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:23.320
Uh, well, I guess it doesn't really
look like a castle, Squid Girlie...

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:25.290
It's poop, poop!

00:09:26.630 --> 00:09:28.610
I have to calm down!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:30.980
This is nothing but a kid's rant.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:33.640
Just because he made
fun of the castle

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.260
I poured my heart and soul into...

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.220
And that hat's really lame, too.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:39.720
What does that have
to do with anything?

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.430
Now I'm mad!

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:43.370
Eeek, it moved!

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:46.350
Oh yeah, I've been wondering
for a while,

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:50.050
but what are those things
on the side of your hat?

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:55.860
<b>Ink that a new ability?</b>

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.550
Creatures of the Sea

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:01.950
Usually squids swim using the
siphon and fins, right?

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:05.630
So does that mean that
the things on your head

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.330
are just for decoration?

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.580
They are not just for decoration!

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:11.140
Whoa, they moved!

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:12.750
What are you yelling about?

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:14.420
They're moving! The fins!

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.140
Whoa! They're really moving!

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:20.800
You just noticed now?

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:24.470
So besides tentacles,
squid ink, and bio-luminescence,

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:28.600
a new power has been awakened.

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:29.560
How about it?

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:32.460
This power is way too cute!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.130
Um, I don't really get it.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:39.650
Why were we called together
for something like this?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:41.190
You can just leave.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:45.910
Oh no, I am really honored
that I was called for this!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:50.840
Squiddie, I think this power
is so you can tap cheeks.

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:52.750
I will be your test subject.

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:55.000
Stop it.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.200
Oww... so happy.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:00.800
I didn't mean any harm.

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.020
Surprisingly powerful.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.800
With that much power...

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:10.560
Can you try fanning with
those fins full blast?

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.480
Huh? Like this?

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.880
Hm, it's quite a nice breeze.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:16.980
Yeah, it's cool.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.110
I don't feel cool at all!

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.450
Oww! I got a cramp in my fins!

00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:28.220
Um, but since you've never
used them until now,

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:31.330
it means you don't need
them to survive, right?

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.960
Squids normally use them to swim,

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.840
but I guess for Squid Girl they
have another purpose.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:44.020
Maybe they're there to attack
an enemy after all.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:47.100
That's too boring.
Besides, she has tentacles for that.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:50.440
I got it! Since you can't
talk under water,

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.440
you use the flappy things to signal
each other.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.940
Hands and tentacles are
sufficient for that.

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.510
Now just wait a minute!

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:59.990
You've only been listing useless
reasons the whole time!

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:02.610
These things I have are much
more meaningful than that!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.550
Then what do you
think they're for?

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:06.620
Uh...

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:10.950
I-I'm sure they're wings to
fly through the skies!

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:12.670
I see no basis to that claim!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.210
As wings, they're too small
compared to your body.

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:19.420
They'll get bigger as I grow!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.630
By then it's not even remotely
related to a squid!

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:25.550
I really wonder what those
flappy things are for.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.600
Yeah, what are the
flappy things for?

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:31.430
Why are those flappy
things so cute?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:32.430
Hey, Flap Girl.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.560
I'm SQUID Girl!

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:39.270
Hey, Squid Girlie, a mosquito
landed on your head.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:42.370
Oh my!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.080
You vanquished the mosquito.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.890
Good for you, Squid Girl.

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:48.400
You can now defeat mosquitoes
without your tentacles.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:52.890
I think it'd be faster to
just use bug spray.

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:55.210
You've been a brat
this whole time!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.100
You don't even have flappy things!

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:58.960
That's still better than building
a poop castle!

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.980
Poop...?

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:04.880
This is...

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.420
Poop.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:07.550
Poop.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.620
Yes...

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.350
Hah!

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.600
How many soldiers
are in this castle?!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:16.010
Huh? Uh...

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.180
A hundred...

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:18.900
No, about a thousand?

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:22.360
My castle has a trillion!

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:25.060
Which means that my castle
has more military power!

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:27.130
We didn't know about that contest!

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:28.570
Be fair and compete on the looks!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.280
Squii?! I'm competing on the looks!

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:34.000
A castle needs to be architecturally
sound, not just big!

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:36.680
Don't you have to stop them?

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:39.460
Squiddie is so cute when she gets
upset at grade schoolers.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.620
Look at this perfect linear beauty!

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:44.240
It's just gross!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.670
Then I'll fight you.

00:13:46.670 --> 00:13:47.840
Dad!

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.140
Dad?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:59.230
Sorry, miss. Sometimes I want to
show my cool side to my son.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.610
His aura is something else!

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:04.320
Something like this, maybe.

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:06.600
Wow!

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:09.640
This is the fabled Azuchi castle,

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.280
with its watchtower on top
of its octagonal hall!

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:14.120
Hah, do you give up now?

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:16.260
My dad is a professional
model builder!

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:18.260
I guess it's decided?

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:23.000
I will grant you that the looks
are squidly nice, but that's it.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:27.260
My castle can be controlled
with my flappy things.

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:28.840
Flappy things?

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:31.030
Behold!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:35.280
It can't compete with
my moving castle!

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.430
What?

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:37.940
Gross!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:39.390
Cute!

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:41.520
Impossible...

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.100
Squid attack!

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.140
I lost.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.200
Dad?

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.710
At this stage, I can't make
my castles move!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.730
I am going to go back to training.

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:06.760
Wait! There's no need
to make them move!

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.620
Damn! I won't forget this!

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.000
I won.

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:14.470
I guess I surpass humans not just
with my amazing squid powers,

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:17.930
but with my inkredible
artistic ability as well.

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.660
Hey, we're leaving.

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:21.850
Hey, hang on.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:30.570
Oh no! If I move, my masterpiece
will be destroyed.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.400
What should I do?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.790
It's raining today.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:48.270
Everything's so wet and yucky.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:49.840
Eiko,

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:52.360
I'm sorry for asking you now,

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.150
but could you run an errand?

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:55.950
I wrote down what I need here.

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:57.400
Oh, sure.

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:02.810
<b>Squidn't you bring an umbrella?</b>

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:07.520
Where are you going
with that stick?

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:08.750
Stick?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:11.250
You don't even know
what an umbrella is?

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:17.030
Wow! That's tentastic!
Can you do it again?

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.040
It's not really special.

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:24.920
We have a lot of plastic umbrellas,
so you can have one.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.120
Thank you!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:34.220
Oh, this is perfect.
Tag along and carry some stuff.

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.890
I feel some sort of kinship.

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:52.400
Man, what a jerk.

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.740
That's such an excellent shield!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:57.850
Do you even understand
what umbrellas are for?

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:02.390
Cold!

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:06.080
Cold!

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:11.420
Stop harassing me like
a grade schooler!

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.890
First, a spare fluorescent
light tube...

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:19.950
That's on the 4th floor.

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:23.010
What are you doing with
the umbrella open?!

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:26.030
Shut it already!

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:27.920
You're getting water all over!

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.520
What are you doing?

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.610
Oh, I see!

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:37.350
By doing that, the water
won't drop to the floor

00:17:37.350 --> 00:17:40.390
and unpleasant encounters with a
wet umbrella are squidly avoided.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:43.760
That's quite a clever invention,
for humans.

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:45.580
You just wait here.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.540
That cake was really good.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:53.840
Yeah, a cake base needs
to be firm like that.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:03.680
I am your friend, Squid unit 1.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:10.050
The shield functionality is perfect.

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:11.940
Next, the offensive capability!

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:17.360
Eat this! Rolling shower attack!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:18.910
I want to do that too.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.320
Don't copy her.

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:27.330
It looks like I have gotten my tentacles
on quite the weapon.

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:39.560
Shall I interpret that as
an act of aggression?!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:46.870
Wha?! It transformed
in an instant again!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:49.230
What the squid is going on?!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.550
It looks like there is
some sort of trick.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.170
I see more and more that

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:04.370
human intelligence mustn't
be underestimated.

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:10.500
I am your friend,
Squid unit 1, mark II!

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:14.840
What's that small stick?

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:22.080
That's so cool!

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.430
If I had access to that technology...

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:30.390
You have guts for coming
here empty handed.

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.460
Think again.

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:32.900
What?!

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.860
You should consider it your bad
luck that it rained today.

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.280
That startled me!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.740
You're wide open!

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:42.200
I'm getting dizzy!

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.690
You're toast!

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:54.240
You have the potential to become
the ultimate umbrella.

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:57.000
Become my right hand,
my 11th tentacle,

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:59.880
and take over all of mankind,

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:04.510
Improved Squid unit 1, "Excelsior" form!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:09.950
However, your tentacle part
is hard and unwieldy,

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:12.440
and your wavy parts are
not tough enough.

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:15.660
The modification operation
might be too taxing

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:17.830
for Squid unit 1 "Hyperion".

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:19.940
Which means that we
need reinforcements.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:22.890
What was that girl talking about?

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:23.780
No clue...

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:29.710
Hm, maybe I need to learn a
new skill as your wielder...

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:32.580
That's it!

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.630
I figured something out!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:36.500
Wow!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:39.000
You haven't seen anything yet!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.730
You're amazing, young lady.

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:49.010
I never expected to see something
like that here.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:51.770
It's nothing trivial.

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:57.500
What good does impressing
a crowd do?

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:02.920
Squid unit 1 "Eyjafjallajökull"!

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:04.780
Where are you going?

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.350
Comrade!

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.520
Sorry for the wait.

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:35.210
What? Are you mad?

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:37.020
Huh, that umbrella...

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:41.480
It's my fault...

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:45.800
All right.

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:49.990
Here, get under mine.

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:00.980
I'm getting wet because
it's so cramped.

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.610
Just a little bit, besides
you're a squid.

00:23:41.720 --> 00:23:44.230
Hello, everyone. Chizuru here.

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:46.370
Next episode, we will have for you...

00:23:46.370 --> 00:23:47.940
Wanna doorbell ditch, squiddo?

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:49.530
Can squids put on make-up?

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:51.130
Holy squid! Is that a secret weapon?

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:52.360
See you next time.
